## 2. Global Registry: `WorldComponent_PawnMemories`

Create a world-level component as the canonical registry.

### &#x20;`Source/MagicFramework/GameComponents/WorldComponent_PawnMemories.cs`

Responsibilities:

* Maintain records by pawn ID.
* Create or update records when eligible pawns enter maps.
* Periodically update records for eligible live pawns.
* Record death context when `Pawn.Kill` fires.
* Track imprint state for spirits, rites, corruption, and resurrection.
* Provide safe lookup methods to dependent modules.
* Perform conservative cleanup.

Recommended storage:

```csharp
Dictionary<string, PawnMemoryRecord> memoriesByPawnId;
```

Recommended public methods:

```csharp
PawnMemoryRecord GetMemory(Pawn pawn);
PawnMemoryRecord GetMemory(string uniquePawnId);
PawnMemoryRecord GetOrCreateMemory(Pawn pawn);
void UpdateMemory(Pawn pawn, PawnMemoryUpdateReason reason);
void NotifyPawnKilled(Pawn pawn, DamageInfo? dinfo, Hediff exactCulprit = null);
void NotifyProperRitesPerformed(Pawn pawn, RiteOutcome outcome);
void NotifySpiritManifested(Pawn pawn, Thing spiritThing);
void NotifySpiritDeparted(Pawn pawn, SpiritDepartureReason reason);
void NotifyCorpseDestroyed(Pawn pawn, CorpseDispositionReason reason);
bool TryGetResurrectionMemory(Pawn pawn, out PawnMemoryRecord record);
```

Recommended update reasons:

```csharp
public enum PawnMemoryUpdateReason
{
    EnteredMap,
    DailyMaintenance,
    BeforeDeath,
    OnDeath,
    ManualDebug,
    Ritual,
    Resurrection
}
```

